{"parentUuid":"c6d4a47b-55f2-4604-b8c6-16877893d5c8","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a0c5ef395232695eb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CrAQHWH1GET9MmfhWDZELa","type":"tool_result","content":" AREA ARCH.PROD\n    ARCH.PROD.roadmap | Roadmap & prioritization across game-team requirements | engine-product-management E \n    ARCH.PROD.intake | Game-team bug & feature intake and triage SLAs | engine-product-management E \n    ARCH.PROD.release-notes | Release notes, changelogs & upgrade guides | engine-product-management E ['developer-experience-docs']\n    ARCH.PROD.customer-corpus | Customer/reference project corpus validating each release | engine-product-management E ['api-lifecycle-migration', 'functional-automation-soak']\n    ARCH.PROD.licensing-model | Engine licensing & terms model for game teams | engine-product-management E \n AREA PLAT.SVC\n    PLAT.SVC.identity | User identity, sign-in, account linking, crossplay identity | platform-services E \n    PLAT.SVC.achievements | Achievements, trophies, activities, rich presence | platform-services E \n    PLAT.SVC.entitlements | Entitlements, store, DLC ownership | platform-services E \n    PLAT.SVC.cloud-save | Cloud save services | platform-services E ['persistence-save']\n    PLAT.SVC.matchmaking | Matchmaking / lobby / session integration boundary | online-services-liveops E ['network-architect']\n    PLAT.SVC.remote-config | Remote configuration & feature flags | online-services-liveops E \n    PLAT.SVC.moderation | Moderation boundary (UGC, chat, generated content) | online-services-liveops E ['modding-ugc']\n    PLAT.SVC.capture | Media capture & share integration | platform-services E \n    PLAT.SVC.social | Friends, parties, invites & join-in-progress | platform-services E \n    PLAT.SVC.privileges | Privileges & parental controls at feature boundaries | platform-services E ['certification-compliance']\n    PLAT.SVC.social-safety | Block/mute/report sync & platform text filtering | platform-services E \n    PLAT.SVC.crossplay-policy | Crossplay opt-in/out & cross-network communication policy | platform-services E \n    PLAT.SVC.leaderboards | Leaderboards, stats & tournaments | platform-services E ['anti-cheat-integrity']\n    PLAT.SVC.age-region | Age verification, playtime/spending limits & regional policy enforcement | platform-services E ['certification-compliance', 'gameplay-architect']\n    PLAT.SVC.voice-text | Voice & text chat sessions, channels, mute/block enforcement | online-services-liveops E ['audio-dsp-mixing', 'accessibility', 'certification-compliance']\n    PLAT.SVC.trusted-time | Trusted server time | online-services-liveops E \n    PLAT.SVC.genai-boundary | Remote generative-AI/inference boundary (auth, quotas, cost, latency, routing) | online-services-liveops M \n    PLAT.SVC.emulation | Service test doubles & outage injection | online-services-liveops E ['robustness-fuzzing']\n AREA PLAT.LIVE\n    PLAT.LIVE.events | Scheduled/time-gated content activation | online-services-liveops E ['package-formats-vfs']\n    PLAT.LIVE.experiments | A/B assignment & exposure logging | online-services-liveops E \n AREA RES.IO\n    RES.IO.backends | Async IO backends (io_uring, IOCP, DirectStorage, console APIs) | async-io-storage E \n    RES.IO.scheduling | IO scheduling, prioritization, queue depth, batching | async-io-storage E \n    RES.IO.gpu-decompress | GPU decompression (GDeflate class) | async-io-storage E ['gpu-memory-resources']\n    RES.IO.mmap | Memory-mapped IO restricted to prefetched/locked or tool-side use | async-io-storage E \n    RES.IO.fs | File-system & path abstraction | async-io-storage E ['platform-architect']\n    RES.IO.errors | IO error handling & retries | async-io-storage E \n    RES.IO.cpu-decompress | CPU decompression as an IO stage | async-io-storage E \n    RES.IO.hw-decompress | Fixed-function hardware decompression units | async-io-storage E ['platform-console', 'package-formats-vfs']\n    RES.IO.remote | HTTP/CDN IO backend with persistent content cache, prefetch & offline policy | async-io-storage M ['platform-services']\n AREA CNT.VAL\n    CNT.VAL.framework | Content validation & linting framework | content-pipeline-architect E \n    CNT.VAL.budgets | Content budget validation (triangles, texture sizes, bones) | content-pipeline-architect E ['performance-architect']\n    CNT.VAL.audit | Asset reference, size & chunk auditing tools | content-pipeline-architect E ['package-formats-vfs', 'packaging-release-patching']\n    CNT.VAL.submit-gate | Validate-on-save & pre-submit content checks (domain validators registered via hooks) | content-pipeline-architect E ['ci-cd-automation']\n AREA NET.TRANS\n    NET.TRANS.sockets | UDP sockets & platform network APIs | network-transport E \n    NET.TRANS.reliability | Reliability & ordering channels | network-transport E \n    NET.TRANS.mtu | Fragmentation & MTU | network-transport E \n    NET.TRANS.congestion | Congestion control & bandwidth estimation | network-transport E \n    NET.TRANS.crypto | Encryption & connection authentication | network-transport E ['security-engineering']\n    NET.TRANS.nat | NAT traversal & relays | network-transport E ['platform-services']\n    NET.TRANS.lifecycle | Connection lifecycle & timeouts | network-transport E \n    NET.TRANS.simulation | Network link simulation (latency, loss, jitter) | network-transport E \n    NET.TRANS.quic | QUIC / WebTransport evaluation | network-transport M \n    NET.TRANS.web | Browser transports (WebSocket, WebRTC data channels; WebTransport where available) | network-transport E ['platform-web']\n    NET.TRANS.voice | Game-transport voice path (P2P/server-relayed) | network-transport E ['audio-dsp-mixing']\n    NET.TRANS.dos | Anti-amplification handshake, stateless challenges, rate limiting, relay-shielded addressing | network-transport E ['security-engineering', 'dedicated-server']\n    NET.TRANS.platform-requirements | Platform networking requirements (IPv6-only/NAT64, network change & migration, connectivity state) | network-transport E ['platform-console', 'platform-mobile']\n AREA NET.DBG\n    NET.DBG.profiler | Network profiler: bandwidth attribution per connection/entity/property | replication E \n    NET.DBG.inspect | Packet capture & protocol dissector | network-transport E \n    NET.DBG.visualize | Relevancy, priority & prediction-error visualization | replication E ['visual-debugging-tools']\n    NET.DBG.session-replay | Record/replay of full network sessions for debugging | replication E ['determinism-replay']\n AREA ED.DEBUG\n    ED.DEBUG.draw | Debug draw API | visual-debugging-tools E \n    ED.DEBUG.console | In-game console & cheat commands | visual-debugging-tools E \n    ED.DEBUG.inspector | Runtime entity inspector & gameplay debugger | visual-debugging-tools E \n    ED.DEBUG.visual-log | Visual logger & rewind | visual-debugging-tools E ['determinism-replay']\n    ED.DEBUG.menus | Debug menus & overlays | visual-debugging-tools E ['observability-telemetry']\n    ED.DEBUG.imgui | Immediate-mode developer UI (in-game, with remote front end for servers) | visual-debugging-tools E ['editor-ui-framework']\n AREA BLD.CI\n    BLD.CI.pipelines | CI pipelines | ci-cd-automation E \n    BLD.CI.farm | Build farm & artifact storage | ci-cd-automation E []\n    BLD.CI.gating | Pre-submit & merge gating | ci-cd-automation E ['test-architect']\n    BLD.CI.symbols | Symbol server & symbol management | ci-cd-automation E ['crash-diagnostics']\n    BLD.CI.devices | Device-farm orchestration | ci-cd-automation E ['functional-automation-soak']\n    BLD.CI.cli | Developer CLI & automation | ci-cd-automation E \n    BLD.CI.branching | Branching & merge model | build-release-architect E \n    BLD.CI.versioning | Engine release management & versioning | build-release-architect E \n    BLD.CI.orchestration | Code → content → package pipeline orchestration | ci-cd-automation E \n    BLD.CI.binary-distribution | Prebuilt editor/tool binaries matched to content revisions | ci-cd-automation E ['collaboration-version-control']\n    BLD.CI.build-distribution | Build distribution to QA, playtesters, betas & devkits | ci-cd-automation E ['platform-console', 'packaging-release-patching']\n    BLD.CI.local-first | Zero-infrastructure local workflow (local caches, single-machine CI) | ci-cd-automation E ['collaboration-version-control']\n    BLD.CI.title-branching | Title release-branch stabilization, content lock & hotfix streams | build-release-architect E \n    BLD.CI.backports | LTS backport/hotfix streams incl. security backports | build-release-architect E ['api-lifecycle-migration', 'security-engineering']\n AREA PRF.BENCH\n    PRF.BENCH.micro | Microbenchmark harness | perf-benchmarking E \n    PRF.BENCH.workloads | Representative workload scenes | perf-benchmarking E ['test-architect']\n    PRF.BENCH.stats | Automated capture & statistics | perf-benchmarking E \n    PRF.BENCH.regression | Regression detection & bisection | perf-benchmarking E ['ci-cd-automation']\n    PRF.BENCH.dashboards | Performance dashboards | perf-benchmarking E ['observability-telemetry']\n    PRF.BENCH.scale-content | Procedural synthetic stress worlds per configuration & scale dimension | perf-benchmarking E ['procedural-generation', 'functional-automation-soak', 'reference-games']\n    PRF.BENCH.replay | Replay- and flythrough-driven deterministic benchmark runs | perf-benchmarking E ['determinism-replay']\n    PRF.BENCH.tools | Tools & pipeline benchmark workloads | perf-benchmarking E ['editor-architect', 'content-pipeline-architect']\n AREA OBS.CRASH\n    OBS.CRASH.capture | Crash capture & minidumps | crash-diagnostics E \n    OBS.CRASH.pipeline | Crash reporting, bucketing & triage | crash-diagnostics E \n    OBS.CRASH.symbolication | Symbolication | crash-diagnostics E ['ci-cd-automation']\n    OBS.CRASH.gpu | GPU crash dump ingestion & triage | crash-diagnostics E ['rhi-core']\n    OBS.CRASH.hangs | Hang & watchdog detection | crash-diagnostics E \n    OBS.CRASH.oom | OOM diagnostics | crash-diagnostics E ['memory-allocators']\n    OBS.CRASH.asserts | Assert & ensure reporting | crash-diagnostics E \n    OBS.CRASH.privacy | Client-side redaction of secrets/PII in dumps & logs, annotation allow-lists, retention | crash-diagnostics E ['security-engineering', 'observability-telemetry']\n    OBS.CRASH.feedback | In-game bug/feedback capture boundary for players | crash-diagnostics E ['functional-automation-soak']\nC-IO async-io-storage | IO requests, priorities, deadlines, completions, decompression targets.\nC-ML ml-inference-runtime | Model format and packaging, CPU and NPU backends, async invocation, precision classes, budgets.\nC-PHYS physics-architect | Bodies, shapes, queries (handle-addressed, batched), contact events with budgets, stepping phases, batch add/remove O(batch), snapshot/restore/resimulate participation, collider history for rewind.\nC-AUDIO audio-architect | Emitter/listener data (multiple listeners), event triggering, parameters, busses, the sample-accurate audio clock exposed to gameplay.\nC-NET network-architect | Netcode model per game type, authority model, net tick and time policy, compatibility window and handshake policy.\nC-SVC platform-services | Identity tokens, entitlements & commerce, privileges, social graph, achievements, leaderboards, cloud save, region/age policy.\nC-MLGPU ml-inference-runtime | Inference as a render-graph pass under async-compute and budget scheduling; weights for in-shader networks.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"142ece7c-d27d-4136-af42-566995fc4687","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:23:17.186Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c6d4a47b-55f2-4604-b8c6-16877893d5c8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1