{"parentUuid":"d62c030c-92f3-4c1a-a5e1-156a3f11a262","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a0c5ef395232695eb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CRmA6BnYnchrdryGo5dzpt","type":"tool_result","content":"ARCH.ORG.triage | Failure attribution, bisection, routing to owners, revert-first policy | program-orchestration E ['ci-cd-automation', 'perf-benchmarking']\nARCH.PROD.intake | Game-team bug & feature intake and triage SLAs | engine-product-management E \nARCH.PROD.release-notes | Release notes, changelogs & upgrade guides | engine-product-management E ['developer-experience-docs']\nARCH.PROD.customer-corpus | Customer/reference project corpus validating each release | engine-product-management E ['api-lifecycle-migration', 'functional-automation-soak']\nPLAT.PAL.cloud-streaming | Cloud-streaming targets (latency, encode, input) | platform-architect M \nPLAT.PAL.os-support-policy | Supported OS versions, deprecation & beta-OS validation | platform-architect E \nPLAT.DESK.os-security | OS security interplay (Defender scanning, controlled folders, notarization, TCC, sandboxes, anti-cheat on Proton) | platform-desktop E ['async-io-storage', 'shader-system', 'persistence-save', 'anti-cheat-integrity']\nPLAT.CON.cross-gen | Cross-generation SKUs & backward-compatibility modes | platform-console E \nPLAT.SVC.genai-boundary | Remote generative-AI/inference boundary (auth, quotas, cost, latency, routing) | online-services-liveops M \nPLAT.XR.reprojection | Reprojection & motion-to-photon latency | xr-runtime E \nCORE.MATH.deterministic | Cross-platform reproducible math library | math-simd-numerics E ['determinism-replay']\nCORE.JOBS.priorities | Priorities, QoS classes & latency-critical lanes | job-system-task-graph E \nCORE.FRAME.latency | Input-to-photon latency & frame pacing (Reflex / Anti-Lag class) | frame-orchestration E ['platform-desktop']\nCORE.REFL.properties | Property system for editing & binding | reflection-metadata E ['editor-ui-framework']\nCORE.SER.evolution | Schema evolution, versioning & upgraders | serialization-schema E \nCORE.SER.relocatable | In-place loadable / relocatable layouts | serialization-schema E ['package-formats-vfs']\nRES.MGMT.gpu-requests | Batched GPU-originated streaming requests (feedback buffers) & latency contract | resource-streaming-architect E ['render-graph-scheduling']\nRES.MGMT.pipeline | Staged load pipeline, per-stage queues, staging-memory budget, batching, cancellation | resource-streaming-architect E ['async-io-storage', 'gpu-memory-resources']\nRES.PKG.install-layout | Install chunks & play-while-installing layout | package-formats-vfs E ['packaging-release-patching']\nWLD.MODEL.file-per-object | One-file-per-object layout for collaboration | world-data-model E ['collaboration-version-control']\nRND.ARCH.instance-data | GPU instance data layout & delta upload | render-architect E \nRND.GRAPH.barriers | Automatic barriers & layout transitions | render-graph-scheduling E \nRND.GRAPH.readback | CPU ↔ GPU readback latency contract | render-graph-scheduling E \nRND.SHADER.reflection | Shader reflection & binding-layout generation | shader-system E \nRND.SHADER.neural | In-shader neural evaluation (cooperative-vector/tensor intrinsics, weight layout, fallbacks) | shader-system M ['ml-inference-runtime']\nRND.TEX.mip-layout | Streaming-friendly mip & tile layout in cook | texture-streaming-vt E ['asset-cook-processors']\nAUD.ARCH.clock | Audio clock, output-latency measurement & A/V/input sync contract | audio-architect E ['frame-orchestration', 'input-system']\nAUD.ARCH.validation | Audio oracle suite: bit-exact offline render, loudness, glitch & latency | audio-architect E ['test-architect']\nINP.ACT.latency | Input buffering & latency accounting | input-system E ['frame-orchestration']\nINP.ACT.calibration | User latency calibration flow (A/V/input) | input-system E ['audio-architect']\nNET.ARCH.versioning | Compatibility-window policy & handshake (live-ops version skew, crossplay patch skew, rolling server deploys) | network-architect E ['api-lifecycle-migration', 'packaging-release-patching']\nNET.TRANS.simulation | Network link simulation (latency, loss, jitter) | network-transport E \nNET.TRANS.platform-requirements | Platform networking requirements (IPv6-only/NAT64, network change & migration, connectivity state) | network-transport E ['platform-console', 'platform-mobile']\nNET.REP.state | Entity & property replication | replication E \nNET.SRV.listen | Listen servers & host migration | dedicated-server E ['network-architect']\nNET.SRV.persistence | Server-authoritative persistent player/world data boundary (write-behind, leases, crash consistency, live schema migration) | dedicated-server E ['persistence-save', 'serialization-schema']\nNET.DBG.profiler | Network profiler: bandwidth attribution per connection/entity/property | replication E \nGAM.SCR.sandbox | Sandboxing & resource limits | scripting-runtime E ['security-engineering']\nGAM.SAVE.migration | Save versioning & migration | persistence-save E ['serialization-schema']\nGAM.DATA.spreadsheets | Spreadsheet round-trip (CSV/Sheets/Excel) | gameplay-data E \nUI.FW.layout | Layout engine (flex, grid, anchors) | ui-architect E \nUI.FW.rtl-mirroring | RTL layout mirroring | ui-architect E ['localization-i18n']\nED.UI.inspectors | Reflection-driven property editors & inspectors | editor-ui-framework E \nED.UI.tabular | Tabular/bulk editing & spreadsheet round-trip | editor-ui-framework E ['gameplay-data']\nBLD.CI.build-distribution | Build distribution to QA, playtesters, betas & devkits | ci-cd-automation E ['platform-console', 'packaging-release-patching']\nBLD.REL.staged-rollout | Canary/staged rollout & kill switches | packaging-release-patching E ['online-services-liveops']\nQA.STRAT.flaky | Flaky-test management | test-architect E ['ci-cd-automation']\nPRF.BENCH.regression | Regression detection & bis